{"at": "2026-09-18T15:51:31.592861+00:00", "event_id": "01M2TKEFG8DJ188FN05JSAKB60", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M2TKEFG8DJ188FN05JSAKB5Z", "input_key": "nightly_marker_split_scope", "mission_id": "01M2TKC7K6JBT3W7RGDZC7SNV1", "mission_slug": "decide-out-of-matrix-test-dirs-01M2TKC7", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["In scope \u2014 this mission authors any needed nightly marker split", "Out of scope \u2014 a too-slow tree is filed as a follow-up, this mission only records the decision", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "When a tree's measured duration is too slow for the per-PR matrix, disposition 1 routes it to a nightly lane with a deliberate marker split. Is authoring that nightly marker split in scope for THIS mission, or does discovering a too-slow tree spawn its own follow-up?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-18T15:51:31.592861Z", "run_id": "01M2TKEFG8DJ188FN05JSAKB5Z", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-18T15:51:31.592201Z", "step_id": "specify.scope.nightly_marker_split"}}
{"at": "2026-09-18T15:54:56.274210+00:00", "event_id": "01M2TKMQCJ9JBP1SK882TVNTZE", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M2TKDY382VFBJTPB21F95HRM", "final_answer": "Both populations in scope: this mission resolves all out-of-matrix entries \u2014 population (a) the ~59 secondary tests/specify_cli/** trees AND population (b) the ~68 no-per-PR-lane dirs. Each becomes a decision, not a snapshot. Excludes the already-resolved tests/specify_cli/cli/commands (#4715) and the entries that already name a per-PR/nightly home (tests, tests/docs, tests/e2e, tests/architectural, tests/ui).", "mission_id": "01M2TKC7K6JBT3W7RGDZC7SNV1", "mission_slug": "decide-out-of-matrix-test-dirs-01M2TKC7", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-18T15:54:56.274210Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M2TKDY382VFBJTPB21F95HRM", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-18T15:54:56.273529Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
